"content": "<h1>該南</h1><ol><li><p>亞法撒的兒子（<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Luke3:36\">路3:36</a>；<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen10:24\">創10:24</a>〔七十士譯本〕，<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen11:12-Gen11:13\">11:12–13</a>）。</p></li><li><p>亞當的曾孫，也稱為該南（Kenan）（<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen5:9-Gen5:14\">創5:9–14</a>；<a href=\"https://ref.ly/1Chr1:2\">代上1:2</a>；<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Luke3:37\">路3:37</a>）。</p><p><em>見</em><span data-bnType=\"resourceReference\" data-resourceId=\"5714\" data-resourceType=\"TyndaleBibleDictionary\">該南</span>。</p></li></ol>",
